EDUCATIONAL DISCLAIMER:

This software is provided for educational purposes only. It is a simplified
demonstration of order lifecycle reconstruction concepts inspired by the SEC's
Consolidated Audit Trail (CAT) system.

This software:
- Is NOT a production CAT reporting system
- Does NOT comply with full CAT technical specifications
- Should NOT be used for actual regulatory reporting
- Uses synthetic data only
- Is NOT legal or compliance advice

For actual CAT reporting requirements, consult:
- CAT NMS Plan: https://www.catnmsplan.com/
- Qualified compliance professionals
- Legal counsel

The authors and contributors assume no liability for any use of this software
in production or regulatory contexts.
